{"seq":2,"slug":"affected-and-impact-analysis","title":"受影响范围分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/tasks-and-tooling-at-scale/affected-and-impact-analysis","wordCount":1652,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"受影响范围分析\">受影响范围分析</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Monorepo 里改一个共享包，直接编辑的可能只有几个文件，波及的却是所有依赖它的下游。「受影响范围分析」（affected analysis）把「这次改动影响了谁」从人的推断变成工具的计算：基于项目依赖图，从改动集算出需要重新构建、测试、审查的项目闭包。它给 agent 两样东西——<strong>速度</strong>（只跑子集）与<strong>正确性</strong>（看清爆炸半径）。本节给出它的形式化定义、三个主流工具的真实实现差异，以及把它编入 agent 工作流的具体方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-什么是受影响范围分析\">核心概念：什么是受影响范围分析</h2><p>把 workspace 抽象成有向图：节点是项目，边 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\to q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 表示「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>」。对改动集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\subseteq V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>，受影响闭包定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>v</mi><msup><mo>→</mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{affected}(\\Delta) = \\Delta \\cup \\{\\, v \\in V \\mid v \\to^{*} d,\\ d \\in \\Delta \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">affected</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mo>→</mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\to^{*}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是依赖边的传递闭包：所有直接或间接依赖了被改项目的下游节点，加上被改项目本身。定义只有一行，工程前提却有两个：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>边必须真实、显式且无环。</strong> package 依赖声明构成图的骨架；隐式跨包 import 绕过声明，会让闭包漏掉真实下游（危险），或因虚假边多跑任务（只是慢）。前者远糟于后者；怎样让图保持真实（显式声明、无环门禁、边界 lint）是<a href=\"../structuring-a-monorepo-for-agents/dependency-graph-and-boundaries\">依赖图与边界</a>的主题。</li>\n<li><strong>改动必须能映射到节点。</strong> 工具需要知道每个文件属于哪个项目，git diff 才能翻译成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>三个工具的三种实现层级不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>Nx</th>\n<th>Turborepo</th>\n<th>pnpm</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图的来源</td>\n<td>由 workspace 结构与 import 推断 project graph</td>\n<td>包拓扑 + 任务依赖</td>\n<td>无图，仅目录 glob</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>affected 支持</td>\n<td>原生 <code>nx affected</code></td>\n<td>现行版本原生 <code>--affected</code></td>\n<td><code>[&lt;since&gt;]</code> git 过滤近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粒度</td>\n<td>项目级</td>\n<td>默认包级；<code>futureFlags.affectedUsingTaskInputs</code> 可细到任务级</td>\n<td>包级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型命令</td>\n<td><code>nx affected test --base=origin/main</code></td>\n<td><code>turbo run build --affected</code></td>\n<td><code>pnpm --filter &quot;...[origin/master]&quot; test</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Nx 的三步算法最有代表性：用 Git 找出变更文件 → 用 project graph 把文件归属到项目 → 反向遍历找出依赖这些项目的项目，只对该子集执行目标（<a href=\"https://nx.dev/ci/features/affected\">nx.dev/ci/features/affected</a>）。Turborepo 的 <code>--affected</code> 等价于默认过滤器 <code>--filter=...[main...HEAD]</code>，可用 <code>TURBO_SCM_BASE</code> / <code>TURBO_SCM_HEAD</code> 覆盖比较基准（<a href=\"https://turborepo.com/docs/reference/run\">turborepo.com/docs/reference/run</a>）。pnpm 不建图，但过滤语法的 <code>[&lt;since&gt;]</code> 选择器能选出某个 git 基准以来变更的包，加 <code>...</code> 前缀即可带上它们的下游依赖（<a href=\"https://pnpm.io/filtering\">pnpm.io/filtering</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart BT&#10;    utils[&quot;packages/utils&quot;] --&gt; core[&quot;packages/core&quot;]&#10;    core --&gt; ui[&quot;apps/web&quot;]&#10;    core --&gt; cli[&quot;apps/cli&quot;]&#10;    core --&gt; admin[&quot;apps/admin&quot;]\">flowchart BT\n    utils[\"packages/utils\"] --&gt; core[\"packages/core\"]\n    core --&gt; ui[\"apps/web\"]\n    core --&gt; cli[\"apps/cli\"]\n    core --&gt; admin[\"apps/admin\"]</pre><p>箭头方向即依赖方向：改黄色起点的 <code>utils</code>，闭包沿箭头扩散到 <code>core</code> 与三个应用——这五个黄色节点就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{affected}(\\Delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">affected</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，也是本次必须重新验证的全部范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对-agent-的双重价值\">对 agent 的双重价值</h2><p>性能一面的账很直白：仓库规模越大，全量与闭包的比值越大，增量验证省下的时间越多，agent 每轮迭代越快。</p>\n<p>正确性一面更值得展开，因为它针对的是 agent 最危险的误判模式——<strong>低估波及面</strong>。Agent 改了一个 util 函数，自己包里的测试通过，于是宣称完成；但它看不见三个应用里五处调用点的行为已经改变。受影响分析把这个推断变成机械计算：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 一出，下游清单客观可见，「我改的包绿了」被升级为「闭包内全部绿了」才算完成——<strong>受影响闭包就是 agent 的验证义务边界</strong>。这个定义同时纠正两个方向的错误：漏测下游（以为只影响一处）和过度全量（每次都跑整个仓库）。它还顺带回答了「该测哪些」这个排程问题：验证资源有限时，闭包给出了优先级排序——离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 越近的下游风险越直接，越远的越可延后。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用好受影响分析\">用好受影响分析</h2><p><strong>改前看影响，改后验下游。</strong> 动手前先查一次受影响范围评估波及面，据此决定是否切片提交；改完按闭包跑测试确认下游没破。把这一前一后写进 AGENTS.md 的改动流程约定，成本一句话，收益是让每次跨包改动都自带影响评估；它与「写集从窄、验集从宽」的任务圈定纲领互为表里，见<a href=\"../working-in-a-monorepo-with-agents/scoping-agent-work-to-packages\">把 Agent 的工作圈定到包</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>开发激进，CI 分层保守。</strong> PR 流水线可以用 affected 提速——Nx 文档明确建议在 CI 上使用 affected 命令——但主干上应保留周期性全量构建作漏检兜底。原因在于 affected 的正确性同时依赖图与 diff 两处准确：任何一处失真都意味着漏测风险，而全量是不依赖任何前提的基线。</p>\n<p><strong>守住两类失效模式。</strong> 其一是浅克隆：Turborepo 文档警告 checkout 历史太浅时 <code>--affected</code> 会把所有包视为已变更，静默退化成全量——安全但慢，CI 需保证足够 fetch depth。其二是基准配错：比较分支名写错时闭包会真的缺块——危险且难察觉。前者靠 CI 配置约束，后者靠把基准分支写成配置常量而非散落在各处命令里。</p>\n<p>还要分清它与缓存的分工：受影响分析决定<strong>跑哪些任务</strong>，缓存决定<strong>重跑的成本</strong>——两者正交且互补。缓存的输入哈希与确定性前提见<a href=\"task-running-and-caching\">任务运行与缓存</a>。闭包内未变化的任务仍会被缓存吸收，所以「affected 后再跑一轮」的实际开销往往比闭包的表面大小还小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>把闭包当沟通物</strong>：PR 描述附上受影响项目清单，reviewer 第一眼看到爆炸半径。</li>\n<li><strong>大改动切片提交</strong>：闭包大小与 diff 大小正相关，小步走让每步的验证范围保持可读。</li>\n<li><strong>定期校准信任</strong>：抽样对比全量结果与 affected 结果；出现「增量绿但全量红」时，优先怀疑图失真（隐式引用、动态 import、未声明的运行时依赖）。</li>\n<li><strong>用边界规则护图</strong>：启用模块边界类检查（如 Nx 的 enforce module boundaries），禁止绕过包声明引用他人内部模块，保护图的准确性不被日常代码侵蚀。</li>\n<li><strong>它不替代风险评估</strong>：闭包回答「哪些要重跑」，不回答「哪些语义变了」——公共 API 的破坏性修改仍需人判断兼容策略。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>受影响分析的本质是一次传递闭包计算：diff 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，依赖图给出方向，闭包即验证义务的集合。速度快是因为集合小，正确性好是因为集合完整而客观。全部前提浓缩为一条——图必须诚实。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"受影响范围分析","id":"受影响范围分析"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：什么是受影响范围分析","id":"核心概念-什么是受影响范围分析"},{"level":2,"text":"对 agent 的双重价值","id":"对-agent-的双重价值"},{"level":2,"text":"用好受影响分析","id":"用好受影响分析"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"任务运行与缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/tasks-and-tooling-at-scale/task-running-and-caching"},"next":{"title":"跨包一致的工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/tasks-and-tooling-at-scale/consistent-tooling-across-packages"}}